  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza Crisis Humanitarian Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment delivers humanitarian assistance in the Occupied Palestinian Territories in response to the conflict between Hamas and Israel since October 2023. The funding is supporting trusted partners including the United Nations and the International Committee of the Red Cross to deliver critical support including emergency food, water, nutrition, sanitation and hygiene services, as well as child protection and women&#x2019;s health services.</narrative>
  </description>
